>>So I always have a bunch of scrolls with gibberish titles.  Is the main way
>>to identify these with an identify scroll?  If so, will I know an identify
>>scroll when I see it?
> 
> Some call me reckless, but I think the most common and certainly the
> most convenient way is just to read them. None are particularly deadly
